WEBVTT

00:05.652 --> 00:09.239
[Ori]

00:20.186 --> 00:20.906
Kame…

00:22.472 --> 00:23.367
Kame?

00:24.632 --> 00:25.504
Kame!

00:27.059 --> 00:27.927
Kame!

00:29.135 --> 00:30.864
You're up next, aren't you?!

00:33.451 --> 00:37.196
Sorry about that. I was spacing out.

00:39.013 --> 00:41.001
Alright, let's do this,

00:42.758 --> 00:43.923
Reversi.

00:45.196 --> 00:46.004
About damn time.

00:50.014 --> 00:52.281
We've been waiting, Togame!

00:52.035 --> 00:53.004
Get him!

00:53.004 --> 00:54.514
Kill him!

00:54.651 --> 00:56.487
Wow, they're really cheering now.

00:56.556 --> 00:58.031
It's nothing like before.

00:58.031 --> 01:00.266
Take him down in one punch! One!

01:02.803 --> 01:04.899
Um, S-Sakura…

01:05.923 --> 01:08.289
B-B-Be careful up there.

01:08.415 --> 01:09.691
Don't die on us.

01:09.832 --> 01:10.807
You got this.

01:13.927 --> 01:14.956
Sakura.

01:16.209 --> 01:18.533
Go have a nice, long conversation.

01:20.396 --> 01:22.072
Fights are conversations, Sakura.

01:24.087 --> 01:26.201
I don't know about that.

01:27.039 --> 01:28.651
That said…

01:29.466 --> 01:32.056
Excitement isn't all I feel
when I fight strong guys.

01:33.634 --> 01:35.916
I don't know what to call the rest of it,

01:37.744 --> 01:38.902
but, well…

01:39.942 --> 01:42.765
And I hope you win tomorrow!

01:45.299 --> 01:47.729
I did tell him to leave it to me.

01:49.752 --> 01:51.076
Let's get this started already.

01:55.325 --> 01:58.004
You don't gotta be in such a rush.

01:59.862 --> 02:04.179
Going fast isn't a bad thing,

02:04.788 --> 02:08.198
but sometimes being too hasty can be unsatisfying.

02:09.756 --> 02:11.801
Especially in times like these,

02:12.807 --> 02:15.009
I wanna take my time and enjoy myself.

04:25.177 --> 04:26.003
Sakura.

04:26.056 --> 04:30.819
I learned in the fights these past
couple days that you're pretty skilled.

04:31.596 --> 04:37.042
But Togame's near the top of Lion's Head,
who believe strength is everything.

04:38.152 --> 04:40.048
That's just how strong he is.

04:41.036 --> 04:45.089
You move pretty fast for a guy
who wants to take his time.

04:45.672 --> 04:48.598
What? You think this is fast?

04:50.228 --> 04:54.598
This is me going slow,
so I can spend more time with you.

04:54.761 --> 04:58.022
Perfect. Let's hang out, then.

05:18.411 --> 05:21.071
I-It's taking everything he has just to dodge!

05:22.118 --> 05:27.485
Well, Togame and Tomiyama have been way
at the top of Lion's Head for a while now.

05:27.992 --> 05:29.352
Wait, does that mean…

05:29.794 --> 05:33.005
It means he's on a completely
different level from the last three.

05:35.241 --> 05:39.116
But hey, the guy fighting him
would know that better than anyone.

05:46.712 --> 05:48.015
H-He hit him!

05:51.942 --> 05:53.969
You finally caught up?

05:54.819 --> 05:56.224
You've got skill!

06:01.104 --> 06:02.007
Hey, Reversi…

06:03.184 --> 06:06.499
You called me lame back in the tunnel, didn't you?

06:07.497 --> 06:10.822
That really got on my nerves.

06:12.933 --> 06:15.417
And the way… you talk…

06:16.262 --> 06:17.805
made it even worse!

06:27.748 --> 06:29.295
Way to go, Togame!

06:29.047 --> 06:30.689
Knock him out!

06:30.849 --> 06:32.567
Dude's scary as ever!

06:32.956 --> 06:35.965
Kame! Kame!

06:39.092 --> 06:40.544
Huh?

06:40.099 --> 06:42.067
You out already?

06:43.794 --> 06:48.308
This makes you way lamer than I could ever be.

06:52.034 --> 06:54.339
Running your mouth at people,

06:54.822 --> 06:56.259
trying to act cool…

06:56.739 --> 06:59.801
Only the strong can get away with that.

07:01.062 --> 07:06.415
If you didn't run with a strong crowd,
you couldn't even dream of it.

07:08.213 --> 07:12.533
Just like how a wind chime
shuts up if you break its bell.

07:14.003 --> 07:15.127
On your own,

07:15.923 --> 07:17.079
you can't say a thing.

07:22.297 --> 07:25.775
Hey, now, I was still talki…

07:28.316 --> 07:30.502
Yeah, things might be like that!

07:31.017 --> 07:33.965
Only the strong are free to do as they please!

07:34.148 --> 07:37.607
You can't even be yourself
without power to back it up!

07:44.788 --> 07:46.822
But if that's really…

07:47.299 --> 07:50.008
how you see me…

07:52.316 --> 07:53.714
Just like the people…

07:57.139 --> 07:58.704
I hate the most…

08:00.312 --> 08:01.977
Then you won't beat me…

08:03.691 --> 08:05.695
even if you kill me.

08:20.472 --> 08:22.967
What's with that guy? He suddenly changed…

08:25.325 --> 08:28.281
I-I knew Sakura was strong, but…

08:28.078 --> 08:30.384
He's this strong?!

08:31.058 --> 08:33.123
What's wrong?!

08:34.468 --> 08:36.628
If you lose to me,

08:37.447 --> 08:40.008
it'll prove what you said was wrong, won't it?!

08:41.052 --> 08:47.889
That's what it has to mean,
by your own team's stupid-ass logic!

08:58.899 --> 09:01.043
Don't push your luck,

09:01.092 --> 09:03.104
you damn kid!

09:12.125 --> 09:14.106
Our "stupid-ass logic"?

09:16.967 --> 09:20.129
What could you know about Lion's Head?

09:24.838 --> 09:28.468
Everyone here is always aiming higher.

09:32.224 --> 09:34.051
They make a vow to assert themselves.

09:35.004 --> 09:38.487
That's what it means
to believe strength is everything.

09:39.068 --> 09:42.415
Meanwhile, you bastards just play hero!

09:44.014 --> 09:46.864
Our strength hits different!

09:49.055 --> 09:50.632
He's not gettin' back up!

09:50.849 --> 09:52.651
That's Togame for ya!

09:55.813 --> 09:58.731
S-Sakura… He's…

09:59.916 --> 10:00.659
Not yet.

10:02.003 --> 10:05.291
I'm trying to tell you… What you say…

10:06.152 --> 10:09.245
doesn't match what you do.

10:10.342 --> 10:12.529
You should rename yourselves…

10:13.523 --> 10:14.925
to "the Bully Club".

10:15.009 --> 10:18.384
Just stop talking, dude.

10:19.188 --> 10:20.979
You beat up…

10:21.626 --> 10:23.272
people who already lost…

10:25.516 --> 10:29.215
and chase freaking middle-schoolers…

10:31.497 --> 10:34.453
I'm not gonna lose to you!

10:47.996 --> 10:49.306
The hell do you mean?

10:50.003 --> 10:51.401
I don't get it.

10:52.655 --> 10:53.984
Oh, I see.

10:55.139 --> 10:57.592
That's why you guys were there.

11:02.796 --> 11:04.213
Excuse me for a sec.

11:09.382 --> 11:11.039
I thought it was weird.

11:12.019 --> 11:14.822
Furin wouldn't step on our turf for no reason.

11:17.222 --> 11:19.523
What were you guys doing there?

11:21.031 --> 11:22.297
Answer me.

11:23.512 --> 11:27.424
W-We found a middle-schooler
we didn't know, so we played with him…

11:27.481 --> 11:30.697
B-But Saruwatari was the one who suggested it! He-

11:51.611 --> 11:55.009
Ugh, Kame, save that for later! Finish your fight!

11:56.369 --> 11:57.958
It just got to the good part!

12:06.487 --> 12:08.609
Man, sorry about that.

12:09.055 --> 12:11.058
And thanks for waiting.

12:14.217 --> 12:17.018
So, shall we continue?

13:08.062 --> 13:10.000
Wow, that's incredible!

13:10.048 --> 13:12.228
You beat 'em all on your own?!

13:14.255 --> 13:15.881
You sure are strong!

13:23.059 --> 13:25.554
How about you join our team?!

13:27.622 --> 13:28.388
Huh…?

13:28.902 --> 13:30.007
What do you mean?

13:30.001 --> 13:31.098
We're called Lion's Head.

13:32.133 --> 13:33.824
No, I meant…

13:34.624 --> 13:36.681
I only just joined, myself,

13:36.902 --> 13:38.685
but I bet you'd love it here!

13:38.906 --> 13:41.276
That still doesn't… Slow dow…

13:42.087 --> 13:44.845
Let's go! Now! I'll introduce you to everyone!

13:49.352 --> 13:52.312
That was how I met Choji.

14:46.099 --> 14:49.146
Do you what it means
to believe strength is everything?

14:50.086 --> 14:52.788
Come on, Kame!

14:52.099 --> 14:54.601
Have you heard? Do you know?!

14:55.413 --> 14:57.523
I've heard, and I know.

14:57.098 --> 14:59.714
I heard it on day one.

14:59.847 --> 15:02.906
Get this! It means not giving in to anyone,

15:03.001 --> 15:05.219
and making a vow to assert yourself!

15:06.007 --> 15:09.683
You really never listen, do you.

15:10.883 --> 15:14.396
They say strength is meant to be freeing!

15:18.067 --> 15:21.291
Our new recruits are amazing!

15:21.363 --> 15:22.708
I heard about them!

15:22.967 --> 15:26.731
They raided Zinc, just the two of 'em,
and beat everyone up!

15:27.013 --> 15:29.081
Everyone's talkin' about 'em!

15:31.428 --> 15:32.067
I'm back!

15:33.329 --> 15:35.801
We gave 'em some punches for you, too, Numa!

15:40.057 --> 15:41.489
Thanks…

15:42.758 --> 15:46.068
Y-You seriously went? You two are somethin' else…

15:46.068 --> 15:47.052
[Heh]

15:47.052 --> 15:50.438
[Heh]
Well, duh! I'm aiming to be the freest guy ever!

15:50.044 --> 15:52.571
[Heh]
I can't afford to lose here!

15:56.662 --> 15:57.699
Uhh…

15:58.038 --> 15:59.344
Well…

16:00.091 --> 16:02.008
When we joined the team, you guys taught us

16:03.344 --> 16:06.102
that strength is meant to be freeing.

16:06.075 --> 16:12.895
So… You think whoever's strongest
is also the freest.

16:13.763 --> 16:14.838
Right?

16:14.979 --> 16:15.087
Mm-hm!

16:16.148 --> 16:19.203
Doesn't being the freest guy sound fun?!

16:19.615 --> 16:22.407
Kame and I are racing to see who gets there first!

16:24.217 --> 16:26.499
Let's all race there!

16:27.489 --> 16:29.649
Back then, Choji was strong,

16:30.083 --> 16:31.725
and had more fun than anyone.

16:32.514 --> 16:35.097
He embodied the team's philosophy,

16:35.573 --> 16:37.023
and shone like the sun.

16:38.487 --> 16:40.194
He said we were racing,

16:40.899 --> 16:43.089
but I never felt like we were.

16:43.939 --> 16:46.643
I was never good at dealing with people,

16:47.029 --> 16:50.525
but when I was with Choji,
I could be part of the group.

16:52.525 --> 16:53.676
It was fun.

16:56.015 --> 16:57.076
I actually felt free.

17:01.904 --> 17:04.186
I thought that if Choji took the reins,

17:04.064 --> 17:07.676
it would definitely make the team
even better for it.

17:12.792 --> 17:13.092
I thought.

17:35.455 --> 17:36.048
Choji?

17:36.933 --> 17:38.038
What's up?

17:40.426 --> 17:41.039
Everyone's inside…

17:41.039 --> 17:42.043
Hey, Kame.

17:43.097 --> 17:45.992
I… became the leader, right?

17:48.544 --> 17:49.001
Mhm.

17:50.537 --> 17:54.582
The leader is the strongest and freest, right?

17:56.674 --> 17:57.184
Mhm.

17:59.432 --> 18:00.445
It's…

18:01.417 --> 18:02.392
not fun at all.

18:09.695 --> 18:12.925
So, well, I was thinking…

18:14.083 --> 18:19.314
It'd be good if the whole team
got as strong as me.

18:26.662 --> 18:27.504
Ah…

18:28.057 --> 18:30.194
So you want to train everyone up?

18:31.942 --> 18:35.325
That sounds good. Let's go
inside and talk to them…

18:35.033 --> 18:36.864
Tomiyama! Togame!

18:41.573 --> 18:44.038
Zinc attacked this guy!

18:45.047 --> 18:45.973
Zinc?!

18:46.293 --> 18:47.485
Them again?!

18:48.095 --> 18:49.527
Let's go, Choji!

19:09.828 --> 19:12.114
You came back after getting beat?

19:13.649 --> 19:17.005
Cut it out. That won't make you stronger.

19:18.411 --> 19:20.769
That won't make you free.

19:21.379 --> 19:22.088
That's no fun at all.

19:24.407 --> 19:25.855
The weak…

19:30.392 --> 19:33.028
don't belong in Lion's Head.

19:38.666 --> 19:39.893
Isn't that right,

19:40.864 --> 19:41.737
Kame?

19:45.299 --> 19:46.186
Why…

19:47.592 --> 19:49.093
Why do you think that?

19:49.653 --> 19:50.088
That won't make us…

19:50.088 --> 19:52.224
I'm the leader here.

19:55.002 --> 19:57.055
I'm the strongest.

19:57.866 --> 19:58.971
I'm free.

20:00.007 --> 20:01.508
I won't give in to anyone.

20:02.171 --> 20:03.047
I make the rules.

20:04.007 --> 20:06.769
If you don't get that, get out.

20:16.921 --> 20:17.855
Got it…

20:19.192 --> 20:22.601
But…

20:22.601 --> 20:26.289
I'll tell everyone what you're thinking.

20:28.049 --> 20:29.809
And I'll take the jumpers.

20:33.002 --> 20:34.693
So please, Choji,

20:36.918 --> 20:38.575
keep laughing with them.

20:40.758 --> 20:42.373
I decided to stain my image.

20:46.133 --> 20:48.598
The sun had to stay beloved.

20:50.411 --> 20:54.979
Even if it meant using that freeing strength
to bind everyone instead.

20:56.807 --> 20:59.012
I had to preserve Lion's Head.

21:01.508 --> 21:02.678
Until the sun…

21:04.491 --> 21:05.847
showed his face again.

21:21.052 --> 21:22.502
No way, dude!

21:22.731 --> 21:23.782
Is this for real?

21:26.582 --> 21:29.097
You're not giving this your all.

21:30.563 --> 21:32.857
What? You think I'm…

21:32.086 --> 21:36.304
You're not trying to hit me,
and not dodging my kicks.

21:39.005 --> 21:41.436
So what are you trying to do?

21:50.304 --> 21:51.977
Seriously…

21:53.031 --> 21:55.398
What am I trying to do?

21:57.003 --> 22:00.006
[#07: A Fight He Can't Lose]

23:30.059 --> 23:35.512
Togame's sandals didn't sound
very wooden when they hit you…

23:36.396 --> 23:40.083
Well, based on how they felt
on my head, there's no metal in them.

23:40.316 --> 23:42.217
Your head can tell that?!

23:43.169 --> 23:46.518
I mean, I've taken
all kinds of stuff to the head.

23:47.447 --> 23:48.213
For example…

23:48.266 --> 23:49.207
For example?!

23:49.268 --> 23:50.038
Stuff like this.

23:50.662 --> 23:51.436
That?!

23:51.531 --> 23:52.689
And this!

23:52.758 --> 23:53.356
And that?!

23:53.904 --> 23:54.883
Even this!

23:57.836 --> 23:58.864
That's scary…
